  "limitations": [
    "No live Azure deployment or real-vendor acceptance",
    "Outbound metadata/JWKS HTTP is stubbed in end-to-end tests; transport and DNS policy are separately tested",
    "Restart proof uses a fresh application context and isolated HTTP server in the same test JVM with persisted DB/Redis/signing keys, not a live Azure process restart",
    "Customer management endpoint authorization uses SecurityMockMvc JWT authentication; CIMD code/token issuance is exercised through the actual security filters",
    "Same resource audience and vendor URL in multiple tenants is ambiguous and fails closed",
    "Strict refresh replay withdrawal can require re-login after a lost response; no retry grace window",
    "Stateless resource-server revocation depends on resource-side session/introspection integration and token expiry",
    "Control-plane seed application and Argus URL-client-id compatibility remain external handoff items"
  ],
